    "reason": "User ruling (HSReplay): the equipped Chronoclaws still has 1 durability, so attack first and discard Hand of Gul'dan; the Duke drawn afterwards was the comeback, but equipping the second Chronoclaws first spent the mana and lost. Equipping destroys the remaining durability; both orders discard the same highest-cost Hand of Gul'dan, so swing first and decide the equip after the draw. Contrast (user): if the new weapon itself is the highest card, swinging first would discard it, so that order is compared instead."
